  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)<br><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0<br><strong>Fits:</strong> All Pistols, SMGs, and Assault Rifles not fired with the Heavy Weapons Skill</p>\n<p>Needs a DV21 Weaponstech check; one per weapon. The weapon loses Autofire and Suppressive Fire. In Single Shot (including Burst Fire) you may fire double ammo at -2 to hit; on a hit, add +2 damage before armor. Both halves are situational modifiers: toggle them on the attack roll and the damage roll. Can't be combined with a Match Trigger or Solenoid Mechanism.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Triggers).</em></p>"
